{"id":"vod_bf_10638","vodId":"10638","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"搞姬日常","name_cn":"搞姬日常","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-11/0b54546c83f3175b36c314c78bf8716f.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在名为霜科的高级中学里，有川姬（桑原由气 配音）是高中二年级的学生，他虽为男儿身，但生得娇俏可爱，因此常常被不明真相的群众误解。某日，有川姬遇见了纠缠不休的变态，不仅盗摄，甚至向外出售他的照片，就在有川姬焦头烂额之际，霜科高中学生会出现了。　　就这样，有川姬加入了只有女孩子才能够加入的学生会，并且被规定只能穿女装出席。个性大大咧咧常常惹是生非的副会长步18禁（摩天楼由香 配音）、运动学业全能却很胆小的会长运子（小野早稀 配音）、毒舌中二的书记爱尔威尔缇娜2世（东城日沙子 配音），在这些“怪奇”少女们的围绕下，有川姬会遭遇怎样的命运呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 01:34:38","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/gaojirichang/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/gaojirichang/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/gaojirichang/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/gaojirichang/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/gaojirichang/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/gaojirichang/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/gaojirichang/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/gaojirichang/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/gaojirichang/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/gaojirichang/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/gaojirichang/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/gaojirichang/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/gaojirichang/第13集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:35:35.467Z"}